{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Misspell</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania, set on the remote island of Melanor \u2014 a place where ancient magic and a mysterious disaster have changed everything. After a strange mineral wiped out a whole civilization, only ruins, echoes of the past, and a strange power remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a girl whose arm is wrapped in a <strong>living magical vine</strong>. It absorbs energy from artifacts and transforms into new abilities, letting you reach new areas and fight in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/Swing.gif?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into the adventure:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from foggy banks to snowy mountain peaks. Discover mines, forests, temples, and ruins full of traps, secrets, and enemies hiding pieces of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/2_Locations.gif?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet the characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet different characters with their own stories, and make choices that change the island and the people who live there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/Happiness.png?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improve your skills:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your vine evolves with you \u2014 improve skills and collect ancient artifacts that will help in fights with various creatures and exploration of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/MobKIlls.gif?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo in progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re working hard on the first playable demo. Player feedback will help shape the final game \u2014 with more features, characters, locations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3235850?t=1746609828","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746609828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/15ee17ca1a1a779aa4d236d3c6a723dac3e015af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746609828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/15ee17ca1a1a779aa4d236d3c6a723dac3e015af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746609828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Misspell</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania, set on the remote island of Melanor \u2014 a place where ancient magic and a mysterious disaster have changed everything. After a strange mineral wiped out a whole civilization, only ruins, echoes of the past, and a strange power remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a girl whose arm is wrapped in a <strong>living magical vine</strong>. It absorbs energy from artifacts and transforms into new abilities, letting you reach new areas and fight in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/Swing.gif?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into the adventure:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from foggy banks to snowy mountain peaks. Discover mines, forests, temples, and ruins full of traps, secrets, and enemies hiding pieces of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/2_Locations.gif?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet the characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet different characters with their own stories, and make choices that change the island and the people who live there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/Happiness.png?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improve your skills:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your vine evolves with you \u2014 improve skills and collect ancient artifacts that will help in fights with various creatures and exploration of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/MobKIlls.gif?t=1746609828\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo in progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re working hard on the first playable demo. Player feedback will help shape the final game \u2014 with more features, characters, locations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Bones Keeper Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/6cce20aec38ec2889df95cb51fd69056010cc392/header.jpg?t=1746609828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Misspell","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li>